{"Django QuerySets do not support negative slicing - queryset[start_offset:stop] will raise AssertionError if start_offset is negative": 0.9259845614433289, "OptimizedCursorPaginator is incompatible with datetime fields used in order_by=\"-datetime\" - it attempts to call math.floor() on datetime objects which will raise a TypeError": 0.9758937358856201, "Changing Redis data structure from Set (SADD) to Sorted Set (ZADD) for the same keys will cause WRONGTYPE errors and data loss until existing keys expire - should use a new key prefix": 0.9818989038467407, "OptimizedCursorPaginator duplicates get_item_key and value_from_cursor logic from Paginator class - should inherit from Paginator instead of BasePaginator": 0.045598290860652924, "Eviction limit of 1000 is hardcoded in the Lua script, making the max_segment_spans configuration in SpansBuffer redundant and ignored - should pass limit as argument to maintain configurability": 0.680988609790802}